  "body": "Looking for a home with plenty of space for the whole family? This one is definitely worth putting on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 793sqm section, this spacious home offers approximately 253sqm of floor area, featuring 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 2 separate living areas, plus an additional 14sqm balcony for outdoor relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a welcoming space for everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen comes with a walk-in pantry, offering plenty of extra storage and keeping everything neat and tidy. There is also a balcony, a lovely spot to enjoy some fresh air and relax.\r\n\r\nStep outside and you will discover a beautiful kwila deck and a generous backyard. With so much outdoor space, there is plenty of room for kids to play, summer BBQs and, most excitingly, the potential to add a swimming pool.\r\nImagine creating your own backyard oasis and making the most of those sunny summer days!\r\n\r\n• 793sqm generous section\r\n\r\n• Approx. 253sqm floor area\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Two master bedrooms, both with their own ensuite\r\n\r\n• Two separate living areas\r\n\r\n• Beautiful kwila deck for outdoor entertaining\r\n\r\n• Large backyard with potential for a swimming pool\r\n\r\n• 10 Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Silverdale Shopping Centre, excellent schools, cafés, motorway access, and Orewa Beach, this home offers the perfect balance of space, privacy, and convenience.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing or attend our next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
